# Nexa Digital — environment variables
#
# Neon Postgres connection string (used to store contact-form leads).
# Get it from: Vercel → your project → Storage → Neon → ".env.local" tab,
# or from the Neon dashboard → Connection Details (use the "pooled" string).
#
# The site works without this — the contact form just won't persist leads
# and visitors can still reach you via WhatsApp / call / email.
DATABASE_URL=
